WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:07.712
So I would like to discuss
about meditation.

00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:10.006
But first of all,

00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:12.801
I'd like to ask you
a very simple question.

00:00:14.094 --> 00:00:15.554
Can you see my hand?

00:00:16.221 --> 00:00:17.931
Yes, raise your hand.

00:00:17.931 --> 00:00:19.099
Audience: Yes.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.268
Yongey Mingyur Rinpoche:
OK, can you hear me?

00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:22.394
Audience: Yes.

00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:24.020
YMR: Yes?

00:00:24.604 --> 00:00:25.981
Great.

00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:27.649
That is the meditation.

00:00:28.149 --> 00:00:29.276
So, finished.

00:00:29.693 --> 00:00:31.069
My TED Talk is finished.

00:00:31.111 --> 00:00:34.030
(Laughter and applause)

00:00:34.948 --> 00:00:36.741
Of course, I'm just kidding.

00:00:37.826 --> 00:00:40.078
But in a way that is true.

00:00:40.537 --> 00:00:41.663
Why?

00:00:41.705 --> 00:00:46.001
What we call the essence
of meditation is awareness.

00:00:46.835 --> 00:00:48.628
And what is awareness?

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.797
Knows what you are thinking,

00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:53.758
feeling, doing, seeing, hearing.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.968
That's all.

00:00:55.468 --> 00:00:59.014
So actually meditation is very easy,

00:00:59.055 --> 00:01:02.392
but many people find it difficult.

00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:04.060
Why?

00:01:04.102 --> 00:01:06.813
There are two misunderstandings
about meditation.

00:01:07.772 --> 00:01:12.611
So the first is many people think
meditation means, think of nothing,

00:01:12.652 --> 00:01:14.529
stop thinking,

00:01:14.529 --> 00:01:15.697
concentration.

00:01:16.197 --> 00:01:17.365
Ah.

00:01:17.365 --> 00:01:18.575
(Laughter)

00:01:18.617 --> 00:01:19.826
Shh!

00:01:19.826 --> 00:01:21.620
I'm meditating, keep quiet.

00:01:21.661 --> 00:01:23.121
(Laughter)

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:27.542
So the more, when you try to stop thinking

00:01:27.584 --> 00:01:29.336
what happens, you will think more.

00:01:29.336 --> 00:01:32.881
So we will do a small experiment, OK?

00:01:32.922 --> 00:01:36.301
Now, please don't think about pizza.

00:01:36.718 --> 00:01:37.969
(Laughter)

00:01:37.969 --> 00:01:39.137
No pizza.

00:01:40.555 --> 00:01:41.681
No pizza.

00:01:42.515 --> 00:01:43.642
What happened?

00:01:43.975 --> 00:01:45.894
Did you think about pizza or not?

00:01:45.935 --> 00:01:47.395
Yes, raise your hand.

00:01:47.395 --> 00:01:48.647
(Laughter)

00:01:48.647 --> 00:01:49.898
I know.

00:01:49.939 --> 00:01:51.066
(Laughter)

00:01:52.609 --> 00:01:55.904
Actually, we don't need to stop thinking.

00:01:56.446 --> 00:01:59.032
We just need to connect with awareness.

00:01:59.491 --> 00:02:02.077
And another misunderstanding
about meditation

00:02:02.077 --> 00:02:04.287
is what we call “blissing out.”

00:02:05.288 --> 00:02:08.792
Looking for peace, calm, joy,

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:10.251
relax.

00:02:10.251 --> 00:02:11.628
(Laughter)

00:02:12.587 --> 00:02:15.131
The more you look for relax,

00:02:15.173 --> 00:02:17.967
then peace, calm, joy, relax run away.

00:02:18.009 --> 00:02:19.135
So ...

00:02:20.512 --> 00:02:22.597
Let me share [with] you my own experience.

00:02:22.597 --> 00:02:24.808
When I was young, I had panic attacks.

00:02:24.849 --> 00:02:28.770
Although I was born right in the middle
of the Himalayan mountains,

00:02:28.812 --> 00:02:31.356
the area, the village, wonderful,

00:02:31.398 --> 00:02:33.900
but panic followed me like a shadow.

00:02:34.484 --> 00:02:39.614
And I have so much fear [of] strangers,
I cannot go out and meet people.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.992
And lot of storms
in the Himalayan mountains,

00:02:43.034 --> 00:02:45.995
thunderstorm, snowstorm.

00:02:46.037 --> 00:02:47.914
These storms drive me crazy.

00:02:49.332 --> 00:02:51.042
And when I was nine years old,

00:02:51.084 --> 00:02:53.753
I asked my father to teach me meditation.

00:02:53.795 --> 00:02:57.173
Luckily, he was a great
meditation teacher.

00:02:57.215 --> 00:02:59.050
And the first thing what he said is,

00:02:59.092 --> 00:03:01.511
"Don't try to fight with the panic.

00:03:01.553 --> 00:03:03.430
Don't try to get rid of panic."

00:03:04.806 --> 00:03:07.684
"And actually," he said,
"you don't have to." Why?

00:03:07.726 --> 00:03:11.646
Awareness is like sky in the mountain,

00:03:11.646 --> 00:03:15.984
and the panic is like storm
in the mountain, like cloud.

00:03:16.526 --> 00:03:21.030
And no matter how strong a storm is,

00:03:21.072 --> 00:03:23.616
it doesn't change the nature of sky.

00:03:24.117 --> 00:03:27.495
So sky is always present, pure, calm.

00:03:28.121 --> 00:03:32.959
Similarly, our fundamental quality
of mind, awareness

00:03:32.959 --> 00:03:35.962
is always present, pure, calm.

00:03:36.379 --> 00:03:40.300
But the problem is we don't know
how to connect with awareness,

00:03:40.341 --> 00:03:41.593
what we see,

00:03:41.593 --> 00:03:44.262
only a thought, emotion, that's all.

00:03:44.262 --> 00:03:48.099
So he said, there are three steps
of practice to connect with awareness.

00:03:48.141 --> 00:03:51.060
The first one, we have to use an object.

00:03:51.644 --> 00:03:53.980
Support, to connect with awareness.

00:03:54.022 --> 00:03:57.484
So this is one of my first
meditation techniques

00:03:57.525 --> 00:03:59.402
that I learned from my father.

00:03:59.444 --> 00:04:03.698
So you can join and you can relax
your muscles in your body.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:06.159
If you cannot relax, also OK, allowed.

00:04:06.201 --> 00:04:07.202
(Laughter)

00:04:07.243 --> 00:04:11.873
And close your eyes,
and please listen to sound.

00:04:11.915 --> 00:04:13.208
(Ding)

00:04:14.959 --> 00:04:18.254
And when you hear the sound,

00:04:18.296 --> 00:04:21.674
through ear and mind together ...

00:04:21.716 --> 00:04:22.842
(Ding)

00:04:23.718 --> 00:04:25.178
That is the meditation.

00:04:26.721 --> 00:04:29.015
And let panic come and go.

00:04:29.474 --> 00:04:31.184
Let pizza come and go.

00:04:32.143 --> 00:04:33.478
(Ding)

00:04:33.853 --> 00:04:38.525
And maybe two pizzas,
three pizzas, ten pizzas.

00:04:39.108 --> 00:04:41.778
As long as you remember the sound,

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.112
you can have pizza.

00:04:43.488 --> 00:04:44.614
(Ding)

00:04:49.494 --> 00:04:50.620
(Ding)

00:04:52.997 --> 00:04:54.165
(Ding)

00:04:57.836 --> 00:04:59.462
OK, how was it?

00:04:59.796 --> 00:05:01.464
Did you hear the sound?

00:05:01.881 --> 00:05:03.591
Yes, raise your hand.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:05.176
Great.

00:05:05.218 --> 00:05:06.636
That is the meditation.

00:05:06.636 --> 00:05:07.804
Very easy.

00:05:07.804 --> 00:05:09.222
Just hear, that's all.

00:05:09.222 --> 00:05:10.765
You don't have to do anything.

00:05:11.224 --> 00:05:13.768
So if panic comes,
let panic come and go, don't care.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.395
Just listen to sound.

00:05:15.436 --> 00:05:17.272
Monkey mind comes blah, blah, blah.

00:05:17.272 --> 00:05:19.566
Let it come and go, just listen to sound.

00:05:20.358 --> 00:05:21.526
So I did that.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.194
But I had a big problem.

00:05:23.194 --> 00:05:24.946
The problem is lazy.

00:05:24.988 --> 00:05:25.989
(Laughter)

00:05:25.989 --> 00:05:28.533
I'm lazy boy, I love
the idea of meditation,

00:05:28.533 --> 00:05:30.785
but I don't like the practice
of meditation.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.747
So on and off like that for five years.

00:05:34.747 --> 00:05:37.667
When I was 13 years old in India,

00:05:37.709 --> 00:05:40.712
there's traditional three-year
retreat going to start.

00:05:41.254 --> 00:05:44.716
I thought I should join this
because it's good for my laziness.

00:05:45.091 --> 00:05:46.259
And I join.

00:05:46.676 --> 00:05:49.512
The first month, wonderful, no lazy.

00:05:49.554 --> 00:05:51.222
Second month, lazy come back.

00:05:51.222 --> 00:05:52.432
(Laughter)

00:05:52.473 --> 00:05:53.641
Now what happened?

00:05:53.641 --> 00:05:56.603
My lazy and my panic,
they two become good friends.

00:05:56.603 --> 00:05:57.854
(Laughter)

00:05:57.854 --> 00:06:00.982
The life in the retreat becomes disaster.

00:06:01.858 --> 00:06:03.401
And I thought I should leave.

00:06:03.443 --> 00:06:04.944
But I feel embarrassed to leave

00:06:04.944 --> 00:06:08.740
because I told all my childhood friends
that I can do the retreat, you know.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:10.408
I don't want to lose my face.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.201
But if I stay,

00:06:12.243 --> 00:06:14.078
almost three years to go.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:16.164
Then I thought, what should I do?

00:06:16.205 --> 00:06:20.501
In the end, I decided to learn
how to live with the panic.

00:06:21.336 --> 00:06:24.339
So now we have
the second step what we call,

00:06:24.339 --> 00:06:27.800
actually, we can meditate everywhere,

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.928
anytime with anything.

00:06:30.303 --> 00:06:32.263
So you can meditate with panic.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.932
How do you do that?

00:06:33.973 --> 00:06:35.391
Just like listen to sound,

00:06:35.433 --> 00:06:36.684
when you listen to sound,

00:06:36.684 --> 00:06:39.062
sound becomes support for your meditation.

00:06:39.062 --> 00:06:40.772
Now you're going to watch panic.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.025
If you see the panic, great.

00:06:44.067 --> 00:06:47.278
What we call, when you see the river,
you're out of the river.

00:06:48.112 --> 00:06:50.782
When you see the mountain,
you're out of the montain.

00:06:50.823 --> 00:06:54.285
So now awareness becomes more than panic.

00:06:55.078 --> 00:06:57.622
More than depression, stress.

00:06:57.664 --> 00:06:58.831
Monkey mind, whatever.

00:06:58.873 --> 00:07:00.833
Let them come, let them go.

00:07:00.875 --> 00:07:04.379
So that is the first benefit
and second benefit of what we call,

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.922
there's a wisdom comes.

00:07:06.381 --> 00:07:08.466
So when you look at the panic,

00:07:08.508 --> 00:07:11.469
panic is not solid stone anymore.

00:07:11.469 --> 00:07:13.262
Panic becomes pieces.

00:07:13.304 --> 00:07:18.935
Sensation here, frightening image,
voice, background belief.

00:07:20.103 --> 00:07:24.399
And if you take one of these away,
you cannot find panic.

00:07:24.732 --> 00:07:28.236
So what I call panic
becomes like shaving foam,

00:07:28.277 --> 00:07:31.489
looks like a piece of rock
but inside full of bubbles.

00:07:32.532 --> 00:07:37.036
Then three, what I call
this is acceptance,

00:07:37.036 --> 00:07:41.416
like self-kind, self-love,
self-compassion.

00:07:41.457 --> 00:07:43.793
You let panic come and go,

00:07:43.835 --> 00:07:45.962
that's the real acceptance, isn't it?

00:07:46.004 --> 00:07:47.964
So three in one:

00:07:48.006 --> 00:07:50.425
awareness, love and compassion, wisdom.

00:07:50.425 --> 00:07:53.386
Sometimes what I call
buy one, get two free.

00:07:53.386 --> 00:07:54.554
(Laughter)

00:07:54.595 --> 00:07:55.888
Big deal, right?

00:07:56.305 --> 00:07:58.808
And all this because of panic.

00:07:59.559 --> 00:08:01.894
So now panic becomes your teacher,

00:08:01.894 --> 00:08:03.730
your best friend.

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:06.107
So I did this practice and in the end,

00:08:06.149 --> 00:08:08.401
me and my panic become very good friends.

00:08:08.443 --> 00:08:11.029
And few weeks later, panic is gone.

00:08:11.029 --> 00:08:12.405
I miss my friend.

00:08:13.156 --> 00:08:15.700
And I finished my retreat,
my retreat went very well.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:20.538
And after that I have been eager to share
this wonderful technique with the world.

00:08:20.913 --> 00:08:23.458
So I taught meditation many places,

00:08:23.458 --> 00:08:26.461
wrote three books, become bestseller,

00:08:26.502 --> 00:08:30.757
and then students and become
abbot of a few monasteries.

00:08:30.798 --> 00:08:32.425
And what happened?

00:08:32.425 --> 00:08:35.636
Kind of new ego emerged within me.

00:08:36.012 --> 00:08:38.139
I thought, oh,
I have to watch out, this so.

00:08:39.057 --> 00:08:41.851
Then I decided to do
something very special,

00:08:41.851 --> 00:08:44.145
what we call wandering retreat.

00:08:44.187 --> 00:08:46.647
Meaning you leave everything behind,

00:08:46.689 --> 00:08:48.608
go on the street with nothing.

00:08:48.649 --> 00:08:50.860
So I decided to do that.

00:08:50.902 --> 00:08:54.614
In 2011, I left my monastery, my students,

00:08:54.655 --> 00:08:56.574
my wonderful cozy bed.

00:08:57.492 --> 00:09:02.663
Everything, and got on street
with only a few thousand Indian rupees,

00:09:02.705 --> 00:09:04.791
and that finished within a few weeks.

00:09:04.832 --> 00:09:06.501
Now I have to beg for food.

00:09:07.251 --> 00:09:08.920
And I got food poisoning.

00:09:09.629 --> 00:09:12.173
Vomiting, diarrhea.

00:09:12.215 --> 00:09:13.925
I'm alone on the street,

00:09:13.925 --> 00:09:15.259
now I'm going to die.

00:09:16.385 --> 00:09:17.970
Then I thought, what should I do?

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.473
So now we have the third step,

00:09:20.515 --> 00:09:23.643
what we call open awareness meditation.

00:09:24.102 --> 00:09:26.312
Awareness, be with itself.

00:09:26.354 --> 00:09:28.272
Sky, be with itself.

00:09:28.272 --> 00:09:30.233
Now, no need to have support.

00:09:31.317 --> 00:09:33.027
Just be awareness itself.

00:09:33.069 --> 00:09:34.737
I did that practice.

00:09:35.154 --> 00:09:36.656
Then what happened?

00:09:36.697 --> 00:09:38.783
My body become decayed,

00:09:38.825 --> 00:09:41.369
I cannot see, I cannot hear.

00:09:41.828 --> 00:09:44.831
But my mind becomes so present,

00:09:44.831 --> 00:09:46.541
beyond free.

00:09:47.542 --> 00:09:50.086
And I was in that state for a few hours.

00:09:50.128 --> 00:09:52.296
Luckily, I didn't die, I come back.

00:09:52.338 --> 00:09:55.299
So when I come back,
the street becomes like my home.

00:09:55.299 --> 00:09:58.928
When I look at a tree,
tree becomes like tree of love.

00:09:59.428 --> 00:10:03.307
And the wind blows to my face
become a joyful experience.

00:10:04.475 --> 00:10:06.811
And the rest of my retreat went very well.

00:10:06.811 --> 00:10:09.021
I learned a lot from my retreat.

00:10:09.063 --> 00:10:12.316
So I like to share this open
awareness meditation,

00:10:12.358 --> 00:10:15.736
but it is very difficult to explain.

00:10:16.154 --> 00:10:19.532
But I want to do something drama.

00:10:20.741 --> 00:10:22.827
And this is what I learned from my father.

00:10:22.869 --> 00:10:26.455
So what we call, this mala
is the crazy monkey mind,

00:10:26.497 --> 00:10:28.040
blah, blah, blah, yada yada.

00:10:28.958 --> 00:10:32.461
And the open awareness meditation
means you don't have to do anything.

00:10:32.503 --> 00:10:33.629
Just be.

00:10:38.134 --> 00:10:40.845
That's all, and you don't
need to meditate.

00:10:40.887 --> 00:10:46.309
The sense of presence,
being, but not loss.

00:10:47.435 --> 00:10:48.603
Be free.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.438
Be present.

00:10:50.438 --> 00:10:51.647
Thank you very much.

00:10:51.647 --> 00:10:56.110
(Applause)

